    "description": "HipAAsynth internal-term to OHDSI/OMOP standard-concept map. Maps the finite, controlled vocabulary emitted by HipAAsynth generators to standard clinical terminologies (SNOMED CT, ICD-10-CM, LOINC, RxNorm, ATC) and OMOP standard concept_ids.",
