    "omop_cdm_version": "5.4",
    "vocabulary_release": "UNVALIDATED",
    "validation_status": "curated-pending-athena",
    "notes": [
      "concept_id values for conditions/measurements/visits are curated best-effort and MUST be validated against a pinned ATHENA vocabulary download before use in production OMOP tooling. See hipaasynth/vocabulary/README.md.",
      "Terminology codes (SNOMED/ICD-10-CM/LOINC/RxNorm/ATC) are stable identifiers; OMOP concept_ids are release-versioned and are the field most likely to drift between vocabulary versions.",
      "Medication concept_ids are intentionally null: they are resolved from the ship-with RxNorm/ATC codes during ATHENA validation (validate.py --write-status), never fabricated. Drug classes map to ATC classification concepts, single agents to RxNorm ingredients."
    ]
  },
